nglish","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVmVyb25pY2EtTWFycy0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAwNC0yMDA3JTI5LTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Veronica Mars 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvQW5pbWVzLzIwMTAtLUJlZm9yZS9NYWRhbi1TZW5raS1SeXVrZW5kby0yMDA2Lw","type":"series","name":"Madan Senki Ryukendo","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/k2Zu19nKv7bT2TBw8mpYaqhUEYy.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5InCCgNPTtJE0UC2XmpfZicrflx.jpg","description":"Akebono City is a peaceful community overflowing with humanity. Since there was a Power Spot that released the magical power in the community, the people were distressed by the threat of the demon army Jamanga who are gathering Minus Energy from the frightened masses for a sinister purpose. The secret organization S.H.O.T. was formed to protect the people of the community from the Jamanga, concealing their existence as ordinary members of the Akebono Police Station, which considers demons beyond their jurisdiction. Kenji Narukami, a student of the Narukami Dragon God Style for fighting demons, arrives at Akebono to fight the demons, eventually getting his wish when he is transformed to RyuKenDo and faces off against Jamanga's forces together with his friends to restore peace in the community.","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["Animes"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvU2xlZXBlci1DZWxsLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDA1LTIwMDYlMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Sleeper Cell 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUxvc3QtUm9vbS0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDA2LSUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"The Lost Room (TV Mini Series 2006 ) 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLXN0YXRlLXdpdGhpbi0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLXNlcmllcy0yMDA2JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"The state within (TV Mini series 2006)","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTAtLUJlZm9yZS9UcmVlJTIwb2YlMjBIZWF2ZW4lMjAlMjhUViUyMFNlcmllcyUyMDIwMDYlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Tree of Heaven","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/s70SvDfPqsl37w5MCLeRCnTTuAm.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5eviVS3KjQjKoxGMCeyn2Zej6Hd.jpg","description":"Bright and optimistic Korean Japanese teenager Hana lives at a small hot springs inn owned by her mother. When her mother decides to marry a Korean man, she tries her best to reach out to her odd, introverted stepbrother-to-be Yoon Seo, who likes to walk barefoot in the snow. He rebuffs her initial efforts, but her cheer eventually wins him over. With their parents on honeymoon, together Hana and Yoon Seo stand up to Hana's spiteful aunt Yoko and cousin Maya, and the two develop an increasingly close relationship over time. Yoon Seo is forward in his love for Hana, but despite feeling the same way, she is unwilling to break the taboo of a romance between step-siblings. After graduating from high school, she leaves for Tokyo with her admirer Fujiwara Ryu, and loses contact with Yoon Seo. 2 years later, Hana, Yoon Seo, and Maya meet again. Time has led them down very different roads, but the love and the rivalry remain the same.","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["Korean"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVWdseSUyMEJldHR5JTIwJTI4MjAwNiUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Ugly Betty","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/prGylxnFpIWMcvHh9sUC46hmiIC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5syecfwO1pkIVViRG3j7UuStCpm.jpg","description":"Wannabe writer Betty Suarez is a plain girl from Queens, who is smart, hardworking and savvy but lacks a fashionable sense of style. When publishing mogul Bradford Meade puts his son Daniel in charge of Mode magazine, he hires Betty to be Daniel's new assistant -- mostly because he knows that she may be the only woman in Manhattan with whom the younger man won't sleep.","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvWW91bmctRHJhY3VsYS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAwNi0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"Young Dracula","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nKNtYVK2vhJudSOCDjhCtqAAZpa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2ZTPDS1BNTgWggSlLLCKBMiqqWz.jpg","description":"The misadventures of Vlad and Ingrid, who have moved to Britain from Transylvania with their father Count Dracula.","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvUm9tZSUyMCUyODIwMDUlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Rome","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1A1BwgWO3Sw379VEhR0vkTuE3XW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b2fhZk0xB2TgMsDXT6goR28PoHX.jpg","description":"A down-to-earth account of the lives of both illustrious and ordinary Romans set in the last days of the Roman Republic.","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLVRyaWFuZ2xlLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMDUlMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"The Triangle (TV Mini Series 2005) 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVHJ1LUNhbGxpbmctJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMDMtMjAwNSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Tru Calling","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.